Modifications made by Geniaz:
  - skills/graphify/SKILL.md (from graphify/skill.md): the package install
    commands in Step 1 are pinned to graphifyy==0.9.84 instead of installing
    the latest release, so the Python API the skill calls matches the skill text.
  - skills/graphify/references/ is copied unchanged from
    graphify/skills/claude/references/.
  - hooks/, .mcp.json and .claude-plugin/ are new; they replace what
    `graphify install` / `graphify claude install` would otherwise write into
    ~/.claude and the project's settings.
